{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10271080","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10271080","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1027108001:0":{"text":"ふぅ……ダミアンのやつ、けっこう足が速いですね。","source_cn":"呼……达米安那家伙，跑得还挺快！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F9CE34D028A0307","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1027108002:0":{"text":"それに車いっぱいの木の実を運んで……あの量は二、三人でも食べきれませんよ！","source_cn":"而且还带着整整一车的果子……那份量，两三个人肯定吃不完。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FDB0932458337C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1027108003:0":{"text":"まさかパーティーでも開くんでしょうか？","source_cn":"他该不是要办聚会吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88849562AC6E9427","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"クイン","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}